{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34365","headline":"奉和袭美病中书情寄上崔谏议次韵 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉和袭美病中书情寄上崔谏议次韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"或偃虚斋或在公，蔼然林下昔贤风。\n庭前有蜨争烟蘂，帘外无人报水筒。\n行药不离深幌底，寄书多向远山中。\n西园夜烛偏堪忆，曾爲题诗刻半红。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34365.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34365","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}